config BR2_PACKAGE_TAILSCALE_STATIC
	bool "tailscale-static"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  Tailscale's official static arm64 binaries (tailscale and
	  tailscaled), installed to /usr/lib/box/tailscale as the copy
	  built into the OS image. Newer releases can be activated on
	  /data without an OS update (/usr/libexec/box/tailscale-activate).

	  https://tailscale.com
